{
  "name": "Ferocious Charger",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can run down your foes, whether you're mounted or not. If you move at least 10 feet in a straight line right before attacking a creature no more than 1 size larger than you (or your mount if you're mounted) and you hit it with the attack, that target takes additional damage equal to half your fighter level and must succeed on a Strength Saving Throw (DC 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Strength modifier) or be knocked Prone. You can use this feature only once on each of your turns.</p>",
